view_id":"cZpyt_Sp8TyykYLxRL9LmQ","date":"2021-02-21T16:47:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9217871427536011,"text_excerpt":"So glad this bar/restaurant made it through COVID! The staff are always friendly and upbeat, they followed protocols for safety with masks, social distancing and sanitization. The food was great! Crisp tots and fries, and the chicken sandwich was crunchy and juicy on a delicious bun. Great place to have a quick bite with friends!"},{"business_id":"4DEO0nDjhS6DifyFP7yJNA","review_id":"BNEzmEOXMj2W1IjWOymrAQ","date":"2020-03-01T00:01:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9186241626739502,"text_excerpt":"It's a very chill spot. They place some music from The early 2000s and offer a happy hour til 8pm. You have to order and play in the back of the Restaurant and then they'll bring it out to you. My friends and I ordered the loaded fries and Mac and cheese bites to share. The loaded Fries have an option of regular or platter size. The loaded fries platter size is huge and so you can get an idea the regular was good for us three. The fries were so cheesy and yummy! The Mac and cheese bites were good but I've had better they lacked a little flavor. The chicken sandwich that we order was delicious, juicy flavorful and crunchy. My friend ordered the bistro burger which she to enjoyed. I would r..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4DEO0nDjhS6DifyFP7yJNA","photo_id":"aMmbKyYKoy8HyFEoNJs9UQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/aMmbKyYKoy8HyFEoNJs9UQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8846499919891357},{"business_id":"4DEO0nDjhS6DifyFP7yJNA","photo_id":"qmp0pC4BN46O5zW5QGhrgg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qmp0pC4BN46O5zW5QGhrgg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8615729212760925},{"business_id":"4DEO0nDjhS6DifyFP7yJNA","photo_id":"PtKXqz2wBlBzvC8eVUHruw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/PtKXqz2wBlBzvC8eVUHruw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8536931276321411},{"business_id":"4DEO0nDjhS6DifyFP7yJNA","photo_id":"Q3SfVOIdvNcDRu6ZZqs9ag"